From 375481e34467a9cada6f7a0014ce4eb0f867f48b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Linda Etienne <lindae24@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:12:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add a pre-deploy check that runs on every push and PR

scripts/check-html.mjs parses every inline script in index.html (JSX included),
so a syntax error is caught before Cloudflare publishes it. It also asserts the
things the session protocol asks for by hand: all five deploy files present, the
shell APP_VERSION bumped, a matching CHANGELOG entry, and no OS junk committed.

.github/workflows/check.yml runs it on every push and pull request. Cloudflare
only publishes main, so a red check on a PR is the review gate that direct
uploads to main do not have.

Also: .gitignore now holds the .DS_Store / Thumbs.db rules that were sitting in a
file misnamed "download" (saved under the browser's default filename, so git
never read it). That file is removed; its content lives in .gitignore, and the
new check fails if it ever comes back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmQNLsJPDr1STYdEbjepUE
